Subject: [PATCH] Sequence stage lookup before invoking its member pointer

Keep the same stage and arguments, but materialize the member pointer before
moving the chain. This also avoids GCC 11 ASan/UBSan using the chain's stack
address as the bounds-check index for the combined subscript/member call.
The complete recovery regression must pass with both GCC and Clang sanitizers.

